    "text_full": "Help Center\nLogin\nProduct\nSolutions\nResources\nAPI\nPlans & Pricing\nTry for Free\nRequest a Demo\nPrepare documents in minutes with Auto Generated Fields\nSimplify document preparation with Blueink’s new Automatic Field Generation feature. Let our AI-powered solution automate the tedious work of placing fillable fields such as signature blocks, text fields, and checkboxes while you focus on higher-value tasks.\nStreamline Document Prep with Automated Field Detection\nStreamline document preparation with our Auto Generate Fields feature that automatically detects and places the right fields in the right places. With this new feature, you can save time, reduce errors, and set up templates and documents easier than ever.\nEffortless and accurate document preparation\n\nSpeed doesn’t mean sacrificing precision. Say goodbye to time-consuming manual field placement and hello to intelligent automation. By using our Automatic Field Generation feature, you’ll experience smoother, more efficient document management while reducing the chance of missing important fields.\n\nMaintain control while saving time\n\nExperience a balance between automation and user control. While fields are automatically placed, they can still be adjusted to fit your requirements, giving you the flexibility to customize each document while saving setup time.\n\nFast and secure auto-field detection powered by AI\n\nOur AI technology that scans your documents and automatically places fields where they’re needed operates within a secure, isolated infrastructure—meaning no data is sent to the cloud. Experience the ease of automation with just a click of a button and no security risks.\n\nSeamless field generation across every page\n\nNo matter the length of your document, necessary fields are automatically generated with high accuracy, simplifying setup and allowing you to send documents faster.\n\nTestimonials\nEducation\nAngelina B.\nSPED Coordinator\nLifesaver for Schools\nBlueink is very user-friendly. It is such a huge timesaver and allows our district to meet virtually and send and receive documents in real time. Users can also see when people have signed the documents, and who needs to sign with a reminder feature to resend the documents. I have no complaints about Blueink! All users are able to access the documents, sign them electronically, and receive a copy in a timely manner.\nEducation\nBette Jo T.\nAdministrative Assistant\nCustomer service is superior to Docusign\nUtilizing BlueInk has improved our department greatly! We are able to get necessary paperwork signed quickly and I love how BlueInk sends reminders when the forms are not signed. We can [also] send consent forms via BlueInk and get it signed that very same day. When using USPS, we might wait for months for the paperwork.\nEducation\nElizabeth B.\nDirector of Special Education\nExcellent product to obtain quick and easy signature\nI absolutely love this product and use it daily.\nEducation\nJason V.\nDirector of Work-Based Learning and Youth Apprenticeship Programs\nBLUEINK is the best solution that I have found for Digital Signatures in an Educational environment\nExceptional! I have told all of my colleagues about this program and am excited to present on it in the future; as it is a truly perfect fit for Work-Based Learning and Youth Apprenticeship Coordinators in Georgia!\nEducation\nJulie H.\nRecruiting\nVery impactful – bundling documents saves us money\nThe business problem we have solved is sending documents in a bundle. With our last company, we had to send individual documents, which was much more costly. Our experience [with Blueink] has been great.\nEducation\nJulie L\nHR Manager\nGrateful for this Product\nI especially like that I can obtain an electronic signature due to folks being at different locations. I also appreciate the tracking abilities. It is simply a quality product!!\nPick your plan\nBilled monthly\nBilled yearly\n\n*Save up to 40%\nStandard\